    "scope": "The two aura CFGs match the complete entry-reachable release flow with strict operations/operand widths/predicates after failing before. Three readability-only definitions in unstable.c and sacrifices.c retain identical allocated object code/data/relocations/symbols. The other three source simplifications were reviewed against native operations; compiler output still differs and no native whole-function equivalence is claimed for them. No full reccmp refresh or gameplay fixture was run."
