  "review_notes": [
    "Aqueous Form re-queries after the signed nonnegative attachment guard, then reads the attached pair from that fresh result.",
    "Pursuit of Flight re-queries after its not-minus-one attachment guard during GAA dispatch before testing can-activate/activate. Resolve and cleanup preserve that getter call too.",
    "new_card_from_list preserves every uint16 type-flag case, negative color sentinels, speculating early return, cancellation choice and mode-dependent ID conversion; it does not add filtering for other flags.",
    "has_mana_cost_0_or_1 snapshots the printed ID before helper calls, retains their short-circuit order, then checks generic cost and all five colored fields; neighboring reserved identity bits are unused.",
    "has_the_citys_blessing keeps a live active-card count and returns the marker card index, including the native zero/absent ambiguity.",
    "The watermark callback still ignores iid/val and reads the current or backup instance ID; Capital Offense counts the same byte range A through Z; same-player sacrifice returns raw one."
  ]
